            </note>
            <note corresp="#d437-f2" n="2" xml:id="d437-f2-content">
                <p>
                    Vicente Ráo.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d437-f3" n="3" xml:id="d437-f3-content">
                <p>
                    Getúlio Dornelles Vargas.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d437-f4" n="4" xml:id="d437-f4-content">
                <p>Apparent reference to a paper, entitled “Soviet Communism in Guatemala,” drafted
                    by Mr. Hill, dated May 14, 1954, and
                    handed to Ambassador Muniz on that date,
                    not printed; a copy is attached to 714.001/5–1854.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
